and so on so forth.

00:11:49.096 --> 00:11:50.360
It should not be autonomous.

00:11:50.361 --> 00:11:51.975
It should be
exactly the opposite.

00:11:51.976 --> 00:11:53.440
Okay, so I like to demote

00:11:53.441 --> 00:11:54.680
autonomy is the goal I think was

00:11:54.681 --> 00:11:57.430
a bragging point that will
