00:12:38.261 --> 00:12:40.280
Dealing with uncertainty still to

00:12:40.281 --> 00:12:42.740
this day things like
neural nets taken an input,

00:12:42.741 --> 00:12:44.100
they produce an output,
and there is

00:12:44.101 --> 00:12:45.510
no uncertainty
associated with that.

00:12:45.511 --> 00:12:47.485
That's just dead
wrong for the future.

00:12:47.486 --> 00:12:50.160
If you're gonna make medical
