out-of-date knowledge?

00:13:36.706 --> 00:13:39.095
Abstractions, I must
emphasize that,

00:13:39.096 --> 00:13:40.700
if you were to ask me why,

00:13:40.701 --> 00:13:42.465
do you think we have
intelligence right now?

