that's really intelligent
system can do,

00:14:03.551 --> 00:14:05.820
is think up and reason
with abstractions.

00:14:05.821 --> 00:14:07.305
So it's a research problem,

00:14:07.306 --> 00:14:10.800
that mean it's a
research problem.

