00:14:42.016 --> 00:14:45.520
with mini batch training
and so on and so forth.

00:14:45.521 --> 00:14:48.585
All right, let me just
mentioned multiple decisions.

00:14:48.586 --> 00:14:52.250
In real problems like
transportation to take an example,

00:14:52.251 --> 00:14:54.480
you can't just have
