00:14:58.631 --> 00:15:00.135
These decisions will
often interact.

00:15:00.136 --> 00:15:01.660
Now, if there's no scarcity,

00:15:01.661 --> 00:15:04.300
they don't really interact
that much but as soon as

00:15:04.301 --> 00:15:07.005
